00:23:27,620 --> 00:23:32,250
His court was described as being filled with an unkingly buzz of eager conversation,

350
00:23:32,250 --> 00:23:38,040
where he made sure everyone felt safe to debate ideas. OK, but this brings me to a massive contradiction,

